            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>At the time of the inspection we notice some air leakage on the following house components:

Receptacles

Exterior doors

Furnace chimney

Windows (2nd floor)

The house air leakage was a bit high. We recommend the addition of weather stripping to increase the airtightness of the items listed above. Only the chimney, unfortunately, there is no much to do. 

</airSeal>
                <ceilings>At the time of the audit, the attic insulation inspection was not possible. We estimated the insulation level to be R-35. We recommend the addition of insulation to meet the city of Whitehorse standard of R-60. </ceilings>
                <HeatingSystem>Changing the heating system is a big decision and it?????????s not easy to choose. To help you decide we suggest the following points:

Source of energy

Efficiency

Maintenance

 Cost (To acquire the system and maintenance)

Your comfort

Since you have some time ahead, we suggest taking your time to choose the best system that will meet your needs and expectations.

</HeatingSystem>
            </RURComments>
